  "bodyHash": "6p6X3/dOs6E=",
  "content": "<p>本模组优化了世界生成时的方块放置、后期处理，以及后期处理可能触发的级联区块加载请求。结合减少的内存分配，显著降低了地形生成和探索时的性能开销。</p><p><strong>使用前请备份存档数据</strong></p><h3>特性</h3><ul>\n<li>降低区块生成时的MSPT</li>\n<li>减少区块生成时的服务器卡顿</li>\n<li>更少的级联区块请求</li>\n<li>降低内存分配开销</li>\n</ul><p><strong>兼容性：</strong></p><p>自动禁用C2ME的<em><code>FluidPostProcessingFilter</code></em>选项</p><p><strong>测试环境</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>模组：</strong>C2ME + Lithium</li>\n<li><strong>渲染距离：</strong>43个区块</li>\n<li><strong>内存：</strong>12 GB</li>\n</ul><p><strong>优化前</strong>：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_46d33d8b-9eac-4812-98e6-abbbb4c0278d.png\"></p><p><strong>优化后</strong>：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_f07243dc-9c39-4d6c-888f-8b286423f071.png\"></p><p><strong>结果</strong></p><ul>\n<li>平均刻时间从<strong>19毫秒</strong>降至<strong>11毫秒</strong></li>\n<li>最大刻时间从<strong>115毫秒</strong>降至<strong>48毫秒</strong></li>\n<li>地形生成时的MSPT尖峰显著减少</li>\n</ul><p><strong>与Bye?Pregen 1.0.4的详细对比</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_71cc8d79-6872-4f29-bf07-41fa5a9cc6dd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"842\" height=\"481\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_69e0bb40-b0ed-417b-bd13-c246e3f96349.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"500\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_e12dcd09-0d0e-4cf0-9b0c-02ea7e0ad1de.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
